---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../../../components/Footer.astro';
import StudioModal from '../../../../components/StudioModal.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Approach — Adaptive Studio"
  description="How and why we work with the autonomic nervous system. Polyvagal theory, conscious movement and practical recovery skills."
  lang="en"
>
  <StudioModal lang="en" />
  <Nav lang="en" />

  <main>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 py-24">
      <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-sage mb-10">OUR PHILOSOPHY</p>
      <h1 class="font-heading font-bold leading-[0.9] tracking-tight text-zinc-900 mb-10 reveal"
          style="font-size: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 10rem)">
        Approach
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed max-w-xl reveal reveal-delay-1">
        Working consciously with the nervous system is not just rest or temporary relief.<br>
        It is a skill that can be learned.<br>
        We help build it through movement, breath and proven methods that have a clear effect on the body.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Who it is for -->
    <section class="min-h-screen flex flex-col px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 py-24 border-t border-zinc-100">
      <div class="mb-16 reveal">
        <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-sage mb-6">WHO THE STUDIO IS FOR</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900">
          What people most often come to us for.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
          We are not only for athletes and not only for exhausted people. Adaptive Studio is for those who want to function better for longer and work with performance, stress, movement and recovery more consciously.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1 grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-16 md:gap-0 md:divide-x divide-zinc-200 reveal reveal-delay-1">

        <div class="flex flex-col lg:pr-8">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">Overload and fatigue</p>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight mb-4">When your body keeps going, but your capacity does not.</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
              For people who have been under pressure for a long time, feel tired, sleep poorly or cannot truly switch off. We help the body regain calm, capacity and the ability to recover.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-2 max-w-xs">
            {['stress', 'fatigue', 'tension', 'sleep'].map((item) => (
              <span class="px-3 py-1.5 border border-zinc-200 text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-zinc-500">
                {item}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col lg:px-8">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">Starting with movement</p>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight mb-4">When you want to start, but not burn out on day one.</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
              For people who want to build strength, stability and confidence in their body without chaos and without chasing performance at any cost. For us, movement is not an extra. It is a pillar of longevity.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-2 max-w-xs">
            {['strength', 'stability', 'movement', 'longevity'].map((item) => (
              <span class="px-3 py-1.5 border border-zinc-200 text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-zinc-500">
                {item}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col lg:px-8">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">Sport and performance</p>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight mb-4">When you train hard and need to recover better.</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
              For athletes and active people who want to support training, off-season recovery and the return from heavy load or injury. Cryotherapy, red light and breath-based recovery all have a clear role here.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-2 max-w-xs">
            {['performance', 'recovery', 'off-season', 'return'].map((item) => (
              <span class="px-3 py-1.5 border border-zinc-200 text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-zinc-500">
                {item}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col lg:pl-8">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">Targeted support</p>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 tracking-tight mb-4">When you are not chasing performance, but supporting the body directly.</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
              Some people come for breath, some for recovery after strain, some for calm or skin support. We do not start with the technology. We start with what the body needs most right now.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-2 max-w-xs">
            {['breath', 'calm', 'recovery', 'skin'].map((item) => (
              <span class="px-3 py-1.5 border border-zinc-200 text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-zinc-500">
                {item}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Technologies — dark, 4 columns -->
    <section class="min-h-screen bg-[#111110] flex flex-col px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 py-24">

      <div class="mb-16 reveal">
        <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-sage mb-6">STUDIO EQUIPMENT</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
          Studio equipment.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1 grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-16 md:gap-0 md:divide-x divide-zinc-800">

        <div class="flex flex-col lg:pr-8 reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Red Light Therapy</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
              Red light helps the body recover after strain. It supports recovery, calm and better rest. We use it after training and whenever the body needs help returning to a calmer state.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-zinc-900 mt-auto mb-8">
            <!-- Replace: <img src="/images/cervene-svetlo.jpg" alt="Red Light Therapy" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /> -->
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-6 h-6 border-t border-l border-sage opacity-50"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-6 h-6 border-b border-r border-sage opacity-50"></div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
              <p class="text-[9px] tracking-[0.3em] text-zinc-600 uppercase">Red Light</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/en/preview/#booking" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-zinc-500 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200">
            Book a consultation <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col lg:px-8 reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Cryotherapy</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
              A short stay in intense cold wakes the body up quickly. It teaches the body to handle stress, recover faster and move from tension back into calm more effectively. That is why we use cryotherapy for both resilience and recovery.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-zinc-900 mt-auto mb-8">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-6 h-6 border-t border-l border-sage opacity-50"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-6 h-6 border-b border-r border-sage opacity-50"></div>
            <!-- Replace: <img src="/images/kryokomora.jpg" alt="Cryotherapy" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /> -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
              <p class="text-[9px] tracking-[0.3em] text-zinc-600 uppercase">Cryotherapy</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/en/preview/#booking" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-zinc-500 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200">
            Book a consultation <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col lg:px-8 reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Magnetotherapy</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
              Pulsed magnetic field works deep in the tissues and supports recovery. It helps calm an overworked body, ease irritation and support healing. We see it as another way to help the body return to balance.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-zinc-900 mt-auto mb-8">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-6 h-6 border-t border-l border-sage opacity-50"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-6 h-6 border-b border-r border-sage opacity-50"></div>
            <!-- Replace: <img src="/images/magnetoterapie.jpg" alt="Magnetotherapy" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /> -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
              <p class="text-[9px] tracking-[0.3em] text-zinc-600 uppercase">Magnetotherapy</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/en/preview/#booking" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-zinc-500 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200">
            Book a consultation <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col lg:pl-8 reveal reveal-delay-4">
          <div class="mb-8">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Strength Training</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-300 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xs">
              Our training is not only about strength, but also about quality of movement. We also use holds without movement to improve stability, body control and the ability to handle effort without unnecessary tension.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-zinc-900 mt-auto mb-8">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-6 h-6 border-t border-l border-sage opacity-50"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-6 h-6 border-b border-r border-sage opacity-50"></div>
            <!-- Replace: <img src="/images/silovy-trenink.jpg" alt="Strength Training" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /> -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
              <p class="text-[9px] tracking-[0.3em] text-zinc-600 uppercase">Strength Training</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/en/preview/#booking" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-zinc-500 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200">
            Book a consultation <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>

    <!-- Pillars — white, three columns -->
    <section class="min-h-screen flex flex-col px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 py-24">
      <div class="mb-16 reveal">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900">
          Pillars of our approach.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm mt-4">We connect expert knowledge with practical work through the body.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1 grid md:grid-cols-3 md:divide-x divide-zinc-200 gap-16 md:gap-0">

        <div class="flex flex-col md:pr-12 reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <p class="font-heading font-bold text-zinc-100 leading-none mb-8 select-none"
             style="font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem)">01</p>
          <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">Neuroscience</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-3">How the brain controls the body</p>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
            The nervous system is not a theory removed from everyday life. It shapes why you sometimes feel calm and at other times overloaded. Knowledge about the brain and body helps us understand those states and work with them more clearly.
          </p>
          <a href="/en/preview/neuroveda/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-900 transition-colors duration-200 mt-auto">
            Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col md:px-12 reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <p class="font-heading font-bold text-zinc-100 leading-none mb-8 select-none"
             style="font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem)">02</p>
          <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">Polyvagal Theory</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-3">A map of safety and threat</p>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
            Polyvagal theory describes how the body responds to safety, pressure and threat. It helps explain why deciding to calm down is often not enough. The body has to learn and experience it too.
          </p>
          <a href="/en/preview/polyvagalni-teorie/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-900 transition-colors duration-200 mt-auto">
            Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col md:pl-12 reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <p class="font-heading font-bold text-zinc-100 leading-none mb-8 select-none"
             style="font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem)">03</p>
          <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">Somatic Practice</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-3">The body as entry point</p>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
            The state of the mind often changes through the body. That is why we work with movement, breath and physical sensation as a direct way to ease tension, strengthen self-awareness and bring the body back into balance.
          </p>
          <a href="/en/preview/somaticka-praxe/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-900 transition-colors duration-200 mt-auto">
            Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="min-h-[60vh] bg-[#111110] flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 text-center py-24">
      <div class="reveal">
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white mb-8"
            style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5rem)">
          Want to handle stress and recovery better?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3 max-w-sm mx-auto">
          The first step is a 30-minute conversation. We look at where you are now, what you need and whether we are the right fit for you.
        </p>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 text-xs mb-12">No commitment.</p>
        <a
          href="https://calendly.com/jiri-adaptivestudio/30min"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-12 py-5 bg-white text-zinc-900 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors duration-200"
        >
          Book a consultation
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <Footer lang="en" />
</Layout>

<script>
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
    (entries) => {
      entries.forEach((entry) => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) entry.target.classList.add('visible');
      });
    },
    { threshold: 0.05, rootMargin: '0px 0px -5% 0px' }
  );

  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach((el) => {
    const rect = el.getBoundingClientRect();
    if (rect.top < window.innerHeight) {
      el.classList.add('visible');
    } else {
      observer.observe(el);
    }
  });
</script>
